    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（重甲），非普通（需同調）</em><br />穿着這套護甲期間，你可以用其施展法術<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.o9GQEt4fYw6WjpB0]{死者交談 Speak with Dead}</em>或是<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.xYpJGRI4xcMa41kO]{活化死屍 Animate Dead}</em>。以此施展了法術後，直到次日黎明爲止這套護甲都無法再次被用於施展這兩個法術。<br />這套盔甲會隨着你靈魂的離去而消逝。若你在同調這套護甲期間死亡，這套護甲也將隨之摧毀。</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE:char;MARGIN:2pt 0cm\"><span class=\"GramE\">板甲由</span>覆蓋全身，且相互連接的模鑄金屬板組成。一套<span class=\"GramE\">板甲包括</span>護手、重皮靴、一頂<span class=\"GramE\">附面甲</span>的頭盔<span class=\"GramE\">以及在護甲</span>底層的厚重的布甲。其鎖釦和皮帶結構可以將護甲重量分配到身體各處。</p></div></div><p>While wearing this armor, you can use it to cast either @spell[Speak with Dead] or @spell[Animate Dead]. Once the armor has cast a spell in this way, it can't cast either spell until the next dawn.</p><p>Your soul keeps this armor together. If you die while you are attuned to the armor, the armor is destroyed.</p><p>Plate consists of shaped, interlocking metal plates to cover the entire body. A suit of plate includes gauntlets, heavy leather boots, a visored helmet, and thick layers of padding underneath the armor. Buckles and straps distribute the weight over the body.</p></div>",
